Design Decision 

The transaction layer (i2c_read()) must decide:

When to enable or disable ACK.
When to generate STOP.
Whether it's reading:
1 byte,
2 bytes,
or more than 2 bytes.

That keeps the primitive reusable and the architecture clean.
